{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>ואכלוהו</b> Three times in the Masorah: ואכלוהו אויביכם, ואכלוהו במקום קדוש, ואכלוהו ויכלוהו. The meaning: I said, 'and you shall eat it in a holy place' — that you would keep My commandments and remain in the land in a holy place. But you did not do so; therefore 'and it shall be eaten and consumed,' and your habitation shall be made desolate, and 'your enemies shall eat it.'"], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:20:46.043902320Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}